## Android Local Configuration Example
## Copy this file to `android/local.properties` (which is excluded from Git via .gitignore)
## or set environment variables: SUPABASE_URL and SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY.
## WARNING: Only use public/publishable (anon) keys. NEVER embed the service_role key.

# sdk.dir=/path/to/Android/Sdk
SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-ref.supabase.co
SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=your-supabase-publishable-key
